// What is on in Blue Archive Global now, for the hub's "Now in Global"
// panel: one small JSON file, served from Cloudflare as a static file - no
// Worker code runs, and requests for static files are free and unlimited.
// `npm run global-now` builds ../now-dist from SchaleDB and publishes it;
// the GitHub Action in .github/workflows/global-now.yml does the same every
// six hours. Kept apart from the audio Worker so the Action can publish it
// without the audio, which is built only on the maker's computer.
{
  "name": "ba-heardle-now",
  "compatibility_date": "2026-09-01",
  "assets": {
    "directory": "../now-dist"
  }
}
